  "description": "(T1) Ash - Reduce and reframe crown by approximately 25% in its entirety to allow more light into the neighbouring property and reduce considerable unbalanced overhang. \r\n(T2) Sycamore - Reduce crown on neighbours (No.70) side and tops only by approximately 25% to reduce considerable unbalanced overhang and to reframe tree. \r\n(T3) Ash - Reduce crown on neighbours (No.70) side and tops only by approximately 25% to reduce considerable unbalanced overhang and to reframe tree. \r\n(T4) Ailanthus - Reduce selected branches by approximately 3m as almost touching property. \r\n(T7) Ash - Reduce elongated limb overhanging Oakhill Road by approximately 3m to reduce leverage and weight of selected limb. Re-reduce crown in its entirety to previous points, approximately 2.5m to allow clearance of property and reduce overall sail effect of crown.",
